Z||000000||DaveL||02-16-2001||08:00 AM||||I realize that it's kind of useless to spend exorbitant amounts of money chasing extra horses from a 2.5, but seeing those larger bore TBI's in the FieroStore really makes me wonder how much improvement one could reasonably expect from the installation of one?? They are not cheap ($350). They also claim no modifications needed.<P>Any one ever done this? If so, how was it? Did you need a cigarette afterwards?||||reg||1
